# Magic 8 Ball
# Get mystical answers to your questions

create list responses
add "Yes, definitely!" to responses
add "It is certain." to responses
add "Without a doubt." to responses
add "Yes." to responses
add "Most likely." to responses
add "Outlook good." to responses
add "Signs point to yes." to responses
add "Reply hazy, try again." to responses
add "Ask again later." to responses
add "Better not tell you now." to responses
add "Cannot predict now." to responses
add "Concentrate and ask again." to responses
add "Don't count on it." to responses
add "My reply is no." to responses
add "My sources say no." to responses
add "Outlook not so good." to responses
add "Very doubtful." to responses

say "🎱 Magic 8 Ball"
say "Ask a yes/no question (or 'quit')"

set playing to true

while playing then
  ask "Your question:"
  set question to answer

  if question = "quit" then
    set playing to false
  else
    set idx to (random from 1 to (length of responses))
    set response to (item idx of responses)

    say "🎱 The Magic 8 Ball says..."
    say response
    say ""
  end
end

say "Goodbye!"
